| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |  Projection: sum(order_line.ol_amount) AS revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   Aggregate: groupBy=[[]], aggr=[[sum(order_line.ol_amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_i_id = item.i_id AND item.i_data LIKE Utf8("%a") AND order_line.ol_quantity >= Int64(1) AND order_line.ol_quantity <= Int64(10) AND item.i_price BETWEEN Int64(1) AND Int64(400000) AND order_line.ol_w_id IN ([Int64(1), Int64(2), Int64(3)]) OR order_line.ol_i_id = item.i_id AND item.i_data LIKE Utf8("%b") AND order_line.ol_quantity >= Int64(1) AND order_line.ol_quantity <= Int64(10) AND item.i_price BETWEEN Int64(1) AND Int64(400000) AND order_line.ol_w_id IN ([Int64(1), Int64(2), Int64(4)]) OR order_line.ol_i_id = item.i_id AND item.i_data LIKE Utf8("%c") AND order_line.ol_quantity >= Int64(1) AND order_line.ol_quantity <= Int64(10) AND item.i_price BETWEEN Int64(1) AND Int64(400000) AND order_line.ol_w_id IN ([Int64(1), Int64(5), Int64(3)])                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |       TableScan: order_line projection=[ol_w_id, ol_i_id, ol_quantity, ol_amount], full_filters=[order_line.ol_quantity >= Int64(1) AND order_line.ol_quantity <= Int64(10) AND order_line.ol_w_id IN ([Int64(1), Int64(2), Int64(3)]) OR order_line.ol_quantity >= Int64(1) AND order_line.ol_quantity <= Int64(10) AND order_line.ol_w_id IN ([Int64(1), Int64(2), Int64(4)]) OR order_line.ol_quantity >= Int64(1) AND order_line.ol_quantity <= Int64(10) AND order_line.ol_w_id IN ([Int64(1), Int64(5), Int64(3)])]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |       TableScan: item projection=[i_id, i_price, i_data], full_filters=[item.i_data LIKE Utf8("%a") AND item.i_price BETWEEN Int64(1) AND Int64(400000) OR item.i_data LIKE Utf8("%b") AND item.i_price BETWEEN Int64(1) AND Int64(400000) OR item.i_data LIKE Utf8("%c") AND item.i_price BETWEEN Int64(1) AND Int64(400000)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT sum("order_line"."ol_amount") AS "revenue" FROM "order_line" INNER JOIN "item" ON ((((((((("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "item"."i_id") AND "item"."i_data" LIKE '%a') AND ("order_line"."ol_quantity" >= 1)) AND ("order_line"."ol_quantity" <= 10)) AND ("item"."i_price" BETWEEN 1 AND 400000)) AND "order_line"."ol_w_id" IN (1, 2, 3)) OR (((((("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "item"."i_id") AND "item"."i_data" LIKE '%b') AND ("order_line"."ol_quantity" >= 1)) AND ("order_line"."ol_quantity" <= 10)) AND ("item"."i_price" BETWEEN 1 AND 400000)) AND "order_line"."ol_w_id" IN (1, 2, 4))) OR (((((("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "item"."i_id") AND "item"."i_data" LIKE '%c') AND ("order_line"."ol_quantity" >= 1)) AND ("order_line"."ol_quantity" <= 10)) AND ("item"."i_price" BETWEEN 1 AND 400000)) AND "order_line"."ol_w_id" IN (1, 5, 3))) AND (((((("order_line"."ol_quantity" >= 1) AND ("order_line"."ol_quantity" <= 10)) AND "order_line"."ol_w_id" IN (1, 2, 3)) OR ((("order_line"."ol_quantity" >= 1) AND ("order_line"."ol_quantity" <= 10)) AND "order_line"."ol_w_id" IN (1, 2, 4))) OR ((("order_line"."ol_quantity" >= 1) AND ("order_line"."ol_quantity" <= 10)) AND "order_line"."ol_w_id" IN (1, 5, 3))) AND ((("item"."i_data" LIKE '%a' AND ("item"."i_price" BETWEEN 1 AND 400000)) OR ("item"."i_data" LIKE '%b' AND ("item"."i_price" BETWEEN 1 AND 400000))) OR ("item"."i_data" LIKE '%c' AND ("item"."i_price" BETWEEN 1 AND 400000))))) |
